<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-epitaph-liumeizi-brick" book-id="b-epitaph-liumeizi-brick-full" chapter-id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-brick-full" source-id="s-epitaph-liumeizi-brick-xiangshan-m9">
  <p id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-brick-full:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">晉振威將軍鄱陽太守都亭侯琅耶臨沂縣都鄉南仁里<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-brick-full:p001:m0022" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBAA">王建之</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-brick-full:p001:m0026" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBAA">榮妣</persName>故夫人南陽湦陽<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-brick-full:p001:m0035" ref="mfd_id2_bu3_AA">劉氏</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-brick-full:p001:m0038" ref="mfd_id2_bu3_AA">媚子</persName>春秋五十三泰和六年六月十四日薨于郡官舍夫人光祿勳東昌男<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-brick-full:p001:m0067" ref="mfd_id2_bu3_A">璞</persName>之長女年廿來歸生三男三女二男未識不育二女並二歲亡小女<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-brick-full:p001:m0094" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBAAC">張願</persName>適濟陰<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-brick-full:p001:m0099" ref="6w0_y3q_k7s">卞嗣之</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-brick-full:p001:m0103" ref="6w0_y3q_k7s">奉伯</persName>小男<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-brick-full:p001:m0107" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBAAD">紀之</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-brick-full:p001:m0110" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBAAD">元萬</persName>其年十月三日喪還都十一月八日倍葬于舊墓在丹楊建康之白石故刻為識</p>
</text>
